# 天秤のLa DEA。's 設定 (docs/engine-re.md, "魔導巧殻 against 天秤のLa DEA。, triaged", the shell): at the title the
# `option` steps set controls on each page, each through its menu command and OK. Natively AGERC's dialog, on the port
# the options panel. AGE 4.45D's AGERC.DLL has 4.43B's menu 110, bar and pages, so the same option names as
# koukaku-options.steps.
#
# - The first `options` lists the sandbox's values; the last lists what was set, the same on both targets.
#
# Compare SYS4REG.INI after `stop` on both targets. On a fresh sandbox, on both targets:
#   py -3.11 -X utf8 tools/drive.py --game ladea native|port start
#   py -3.11 -X utf8 tools/drive.py --game ladea native|port run tools/drive/scenarios/ladea-options.steps
#   py -3.11 -X utf8 tools/drive.py --game ladea native|port stop

rand-seed 13
wait-state script=TITLE timeout=120
settle timeout=20

options                                 # the sandbox's values
option auto-wait-voice-end off          # 音声終了まで待つ; on 4.45D the voice group's 文字単位時間 stays enabled
option auto-pitch-voice 230
option auto-wait-voice 900
option auto-pitch-text 370
option auto-wait-text 1200
option message-speed 30                 # the ﾒｯｾｰｼﾞ page
option wheel-advance on
option se-volume 7000                   # the ｻｳﾝﾄﾞ page
option lower-bgm-level 30
option effect-skip on                   # the その他 page
wait 1
options                                 # the values set above
expect script=TITLE
shot ladea-options
